FrontierAgent (Apodex)
https://github.com/ApodexAI/FrontierAgent
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

FrontierAgent and AgentHarness share a common lineage, so the modules below
are ported with the package name rewritten from ``frontier_agent`` to
``agent_harness`` and are otherwise substantially unmodified. Each ported
file carries a header comment naming its original path.

  agent_harness/infra/usage_meter.py
  agent_harness/infra/retriable.py
  agent_harness/infra/prompt_cache.py
  agent_harness/infra/llm/fallback.py
  agent_harness/core/runtime/loop/message_trimmer.py
  agent_harness/core/runtime/loop/context_budget.py   (truncate_text_to_tokens only)
  agent_harness/models/task_budget.py
  agent_harness/models/agent_message.py
  agent_harness/utils/language.py
  agent_harness/components/agent_bus/**
  agent_harness/components/finalization/**
  agent_harness/components/observers/**               (several; see file headers)
  agent_harness/components/middleware/llm/stream_repetition.py
  agent_harness/components/task_board_types.py
  agent_harness/scheduling/workflow_defaults.py
  workflows/_shared/**
  plugins/tools/**                                    (several; see file headers)

