DeerFlow
https://github.com/bytedance/deer-flow
Licensed under the MIT License.

No DeerFlow source code is included. The following modules re-implement
designs described by DeerFlow's documentation and source, and say so in
their module docstrings:

  workflows/deep_research/stop_reason.py            (additive stop_reason
                                                     guard protocol)
  workflows/deep_research/observers/tool_progress.py (no-new-information
                                                     stagnation guard)
